            "golden": "{\"reply\": \"Hi Chris,\\n\\nI'm Dana Cruz's AI assistant at Hill Country Realty. The home you looked at on 1209 Cole St just dropped its price from $575,000 to $549,000.\\n\\nWould you like Dana to set up another look?\\n\\nAlly\"}"
        },
